    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED), in partnership with the Islamic University of Maldives and the University of Colombo, Sri Lanka, marked the official launch of an innovative project titled 'Scaling Impact of a Play-Based Child-to-Child Approach to Make Pre-School to Primary School Transition Fun and Inclusive.' This project is funded by the International Development Research Centre (IDRC) Canada through the GPE Knowledge and Innovation Exchange (KIX).",
